							<p class="plenary-title">Empowering AI with Human Insight: Navigating Challenges and Opportunities in Responsible, Trustworthy, and Participatory AI Development </p>
							<h4 class="plenary-names"><a href="https://www.mmu.ac.uk/staff/profile/professor-keeley-crockett" target="_blank">Keeley Crockett </a></h4>
							<p class="plenary-institution">
							Manchester Metropolitan University, UK
							</p>
